  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 616762007552
    m_Localized: Below you can view your results. The recording is automatically
      assessed by an AI model.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 669878673408
    m_Localized: Proficiency level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3049957449728
    m_Localized: OVERALL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2876388761600
    m_Localized: Pronunciation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2907997036544
    m_Localized: Range
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2925197877248
    m_Localized: Accuracy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2951772987392
    m_Localized: Fluency
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3382343458816
    m_Localized: What did you think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3550702821376
    m_Localized: New task
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3698728198144
    m_Localized: What we heard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4093949075456
    m_Localized: Your answer did not seem to match the task. Please check the task
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4361424035840
    m_Localized: Your answer only partly matched the task, so these scores may not
      reflect your true level. This check is automatic and can be wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4677976547328
    m_Localized: (Nothing was recognised in this recording)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5920983703552
    m_Localized: Good to know!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6000499318784
    m_Localized: 'You can get additional information about the feedback by pressing
      the stars under the titles:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6150844145664
    m_Localized: "You can also see your current level of each measured category according
      to the Common European Framework of Reference for Languages \u200B\u200B(A1,
      A2, A2+, B1) next to the stars:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6162076491776
    m_Localized: 'Please keep in mind that with this application it is not possible
      to reach B2 or higher level of proficiency.  '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6343601774592
    m_Localized: Measures the overall speech ability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6757755740160
    m_Localized: Checks whether you pronounced the words correctly. Measures how
      well the machine understands your speech.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6846674984960
    m_Localized: Measures the versatility of the language used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6874936205312
    m_Localized: Measures precision, correctness, and how well you followed grammar
      rules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6939780145152
    m_Localized: Measures the speed, pauses and hesitations in your speech.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7719484481536
    m_Localized: Do you think the result is accurate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8025454764032
    m_Localized: Was the result easy to understand?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8115305144320
    m_Localized: Here you can provide additional feedback (max. 250 characters).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8203180007424
    m_Localized: Send
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
